---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Projects & Experience | Naim Afgan">
  <main class="min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    
    {/* HEADER STRANICE */}
    <header class="mb-12 mt-8 animate-fade-in">
      <a href="/" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 text-sm font-mono mb-4 inline-block">← Nazad na Početnu</a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4">
        Profesionalni <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-purple-500">Timeline</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-2xl">
        Više od 20 godina iskustva u vođenju transformacija u visoko regulisanim industrijama (Pharma, Fintech, Telecom, Healthcare).
      </p>
    </header>

    {/* TIMELINE SEKCIJA */}
    <div class="space-y-8 relative before:absolute before:inset-0 before:ml-5 before:-translate-x-px md:before:mx-auto md:before:translate-x-0 before:h-full before:w-0.5 before:bg-gradient-to-b before:from-transparent before:via-slate-700 before:to-transparent">

      {/* 1. AAC Mena (Current) */}
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group is-active">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10 text-blue-400">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v4"/><path d="m16.2 7.8 2.9-2.9"/><path d="M18 12h4"/><path d="m16.2 16.2 2.9 2.9"/><path d="M12 18v4"/><path d="m4.9 19.1 2.9-2.9"/><path d="M2 12h4"/><path d="m4.9 4.9 2.9 2.9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-slate-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-colors shadow-lg">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Digital AI Integration Lead</h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-blue-300 bg-blue-900/20 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-blue-900/50">2025 - Present</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-purple-400 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">AAC Mena - Aswar Akka Consultancy</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm list-disc list-outside ml-4">
            <li>Vođenje AI transformacije za veleprodajne (Wholesale) web platforme.</li>
            <li>Dizajniranje procesa za sigurnu primjenu AI-a uz strogu kontrolu kvalitete podataka.</li>
            <li>Coaching cross-functional timova kroz praktične "playbook-e".</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 2. Hikma Pharmaceuticals */}
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10 text-green-400">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.8 2.3A.3.3 0 1 0 5 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v5a6 6 0 0 0 6 6v0a6 6 0 0 0 6-6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1a.2.2 0 1 0 .3.3"/><path d="M8 15v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2v0a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6"/><path d="M12 22v-6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-slate-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-green-500/30 transition-colors shadow-lg">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Project Delivery Expert</h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-700/50 px-2 py-1 rounded">2025</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-green-400 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">Hikma Pharmaceuticals</p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">
            Digitalna transformacija u visoko regulisanom farmaceutskom okruženju sa fokusom na AI Risk Assessment i usklađenost sa regulativama.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 3. APP IT (Fintech) */}
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10 text-purple-400">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"/><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-slate-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-colors shadow-lg">
           <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Senior Project Manager</h3>
             <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-700/50 px-2 py-1 rounded">2024 - 2025</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-purple-400 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">APP IT (Fintech Focus)</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm list-disc list-outside ml-4">
            <li>Isporuka AI rješenja za međunarodne klijente u bankarskom sektoru.</li>
            <li>Fokus na auditabilnost i transparentnost AI procesa (Compliance).</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 4. ZIRA (Telecom) */}
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10 text-orange-400">
           <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"/><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"/><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"/><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-slate-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-orange-500/30 transition-colors shadow-lg">
           <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Project Manager</h3>
             <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-700/50 px-2 py-1 rounded">2021 - 2024</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-orange-400 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">ZIRA</p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">
            Vođenje kompleksnih transformacijskih projekata za Telecom klijente u Italiji, Bahrainu i KSA. Priprema temelja za automatizaciju i analitiku.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 5. InMotion (Transport) */}
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10 text-cyan-400">
           <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-slate-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-colors shadow-lg">
           <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Lead Project Manager</h3>
             <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-700/50 px-2 py-1 rounded">2020</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">InMotion</p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">
             Velika nadogradnja cloud aplikacija za klijenta u transportnom sektoru SAD-a, uz fokus na stabilnost operacija i suradnju timova.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

       {/* 6. McKesson (Healthcare) */}
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10 text-teal-400">
           <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-slate-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-teal-500/30 transition-colors shadow-lg">
           <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Delivery Manager</h3>
             <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-700/50 px-2 py-1 rounded">2018 - 2020</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-teal-400 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">McKesson Corporation (Healthcare)</p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">
             Transformacija u visoko regulisanom zdravstvenom okruženju. Primjena formalnog Change Managementa za sigurno usvajanje novih sistema.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

       {/* 7. Authority Partners (NOVO) */}
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10 text-indigo-400">
           <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-slate-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-indigo-500/30 transition-colors shadow-lg">
           <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Engineering Manager</h3>
             <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-slate-700/50 px-2 py-1 rounded">2016 - 2018</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-indigo-400 text-sm font-semibold mb-3">Authority Partners</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm list-disc list-outside ml-4">
            <li>Vođenje velikih cross-functional timova u razvoju softvera za zdravstvo i finansije (SAD klijenti).</li>
            <li>Promoviranje Scrum praksi i agilnih metodologija.</li>
            <li>Pokretanje "multi-level" programa obuke za usvajanje novih sistema i načina rada.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    
    </div>

    {/* DOWNLOAD CV BUTTON */}
    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <a 
        href="/resume.pdf" 
        target="_blank"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-slate-900 px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
        Preuzmite puni CV
      </a>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .animate-fade-in {
    animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }
  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
</style>